## Before Coding

1. Read `requirements.md`.
2. Run `octopus task next` - identify the next unblocked task.
3. Read `.octopus/context/current_context.md`.
{% if project_type in ["machine learning", "deep learning", "rag"] %}
4. Read `ml_design.md` and `experiment_plan.md`.
